        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-01-06T00:03:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Good to hear! I have an 11 year old in my life who I think would love the game, but I was worried that it would be a bit beyond his grasp. Maybe I’ll just have him try it out and start with characters with easier to grasp mechanics (maybe Ra?). Did you take this route in introducing the game or just let them choose whichever characters sounded cool?</p>",
